Source mapping and modifications, 2026-09-21:
- simulation/actuator.py selects source STEP/STL parts from
  mechanics/actuator_module_v1, adds kinematics and analytic belts, and
  represents reference motor geometry where the source supplies only a shaft.
- layout.py records documented centers, tooth counts and belt dimensions;
  seats.py records measured interference.
- tests and tools/probe.py check source and assembly measurements.
- docs/ records the source readings and motion-helper checks.
The upstream geometry and implementation are unchanged. Incorporated source
material retains BSD attribution alongside the AGPL grant on additions.

